# H6199 colour-mode status reply, captured from the Govee Home iOS app driving the
# DreamView T1 over BLE. Taken with the light showing a static colour. Its body is entirely zero, so this reply says which mode is active and nothing more.
id: h6199_status_colour_mode_static
data: h6199_status_colour_mode_static.bin
imports:
  - h6199_status_reply
asserts:
  - actual: domain
    expected: 5
  - actual: body.mode
    expected: 21
